{"name":"Dreamless Sleep","hex":"#111111","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dreamless","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Without dreams."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dreamless"},{"term":"sleep","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To rest in a state of reduced consciousness.","To have sexual intercourse (see sleep with)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The state of reduced consciousness during which a human or animal rests in a daily rhythm.","An act or instance of sleeping."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sleep"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dreamless","blocks":[{"text":"Dreamless is the third studio album by American death metal band Fallujah, released on April 29, 2016. It was the last album to feature Alex Hofmann on vocals and Brian James on guitar before both departed the band between 2017 and 2019, respectively. The album was produced by Zack Ohren at Sharkbite Studios in Oakland, California, and Mark Lewis of Audio Hammer Studios. The artwork was made by Peter Mohrbacher."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/07/Fallujah_Dreamless.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dreamless","wikidata":"Q25096383"},{"title":"Sleep","blocks":[{"text":"Sleep is a state of reduced mental and physical activity in which consciousness is altered and certain sensory activity is inhibited. During sleep, there is a marked decrease in muscle activity and interactions with the surrounding environment. While sleep differs from wakefulness in terms of the ability to react to stimuli, it still involves active brain patterns, making it more reactive than a coma or disorders of consciousness."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Domenico_Fetti_-_Sleeping_Girl_-_WGA7863.jpg/330px-Domenico_Fetti_-_Sleeping_Girl_-_WGA7863.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_con